---
import LargeContainer from "./foundation/LargeContainer.astro";
import headshot from "../assets/images/about/headshot-light.jpg?url";
import SmallContainer from "./foundation/SmallContainer.astro";
---

<LargeContainer>
	<div class="grid gap-y-1">
		<div class="font-mono-space leading-normal text-slate-600">About</div>
		<h2 class="text-4xl font-medium leading-normal">
			<!-- What drives great product design -->
			My design philosophy
		</h2>
	</div>
	<img
		src={headshot}
		alt="Samantha Albrecht headshot"
		class="mx-auto w-full rounded-md pb-16 pt-8"
	/>
	<SmallContainer>
		<div class="grid gap-y-4">
			<p class="leading-loose">
				Hi! I'm Samantha, a product designer and developer with over five years
				of experience creating and shipping SaaS products.
			</p>
			<p class="leading-loose">
				I believe two traits are core to my approach: <span class="font-bold"
					>curiosity and resilience</span
				>. Curiosity drives me to dig deep into user research, ask questions,
				and explore possibilities. It fuels me to uncover user needs and find
				innovative design solutions to complex problems.
			</p>
			<p class="leading-loose">
				Resilience is crucial in the face of obstacles and setbacks. Product
				design is a dynamic field, and challenges are a natural part of the
				process. Resilience helps me navigate ambiguity and keep projects moving
				forward towards a solution.
			</p>
			<p class="leading-loose">
				By continuously learning and experimenting, I aim to design products
				that serve users while driving measurable business impact.
			</p>
		</div>
	</SmallContainer>
</LargeContainer>
